---
title: Upgrade command drawer
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Ready
    Ready --> Running : Run
    Running --> Refreshing : Process exits
    Refreshing --> Output : Plan refreshed
    Output --> Running : Run again
    Output --> Ready : Close drawer
    classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    class Running live
    class Refreshing wait
    note right of Refreshing
        Exit and output stay visible.
        The read uses the selected CLI.
    end note
